---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-07 - Set the Current Academic Term
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADM as System Administrator
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as AcademicTermsController
    participant S as AcademicTermService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    ADM->>W: Edit term "Fall 2026", status = current
    W->>C: PUT /api/AcademicTerms/{id} {termName, startDate, endDate, status}
    C->>S: UpdateAsync(TermId, request)
    S->>S: Check endDate is after startDate and the name is unique
    opt status = current
        S->>R: Find the other current term
        S->>R: PrepareUpdate it to past
    end
    S->>R: Update the term, SaveAsync()
    R->>DB: UPDATE ACADEMICTERMS
    S->>S: Log activity academicTermUpdated
    S-->>C: UpdateAcademicTermResponse
    C-->>W: 200 OK
